    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      308.33,
      401.89,
      343.07
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Office on MissingPersons (Establishment, Administration and Discharge ofFunctions) (Amendment) Act, No. of 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      355.13,
      401.86,
      389.87
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 11 of the Office on Missing Persons(Establishment, Administration and Discharge of Functions)Act, No. 14 of 2016 is hereby amended as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      183.57,
      401.93,
      401.86,
      413.27
    ],
    "text": "(1)by the repeal of paragraph (a) of that section; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      183.57,
      425.33,
      401.85,
      448.43
    ],
    "text": "(2)by the renumbering of paragraphs (b), (c), (d) and(e) of that section as paragraphs (a), (b), (c) and (d).",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      460.25,
      401.9,
      483.47
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
